  <div className="erp-hero transport-hero"><div><div className="eyebrow">Campus mobility</div><h2>School Transport</h2><p>Manage routes, stops, vehicles, drivers and student allocations from one operational view.</p></div><div className="hero-badge">{totalAssigned} students assigned</div></div>
